<title>DUBAI: Saudi Aramco raises A-960 bunker fuel $4 a tonne.</title>
<headline>Saudi Aramco raises A-960 bunker fuel $4 a tonne.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Aramco said on Wednesday it had increased A-960 bunker fuel by $4 a tonne, effective November 14.</p>
<p>A-960 from Gulf ports will be $126 a tonne ($19.34 a barrel) and $130 ($19.95 a barrel). A-888 is unchanged at $225 a tonne.</p>
